Scope notice (not part of the MIT grant)

This license covers only the original code, tests, tooling and documentation
written for REANIMATOR, and the original 3D models and procedurally
synthesized audio created for it (new designs, unrelated to Abuse's art).
Generated 3D models are recorded in reference/manifests/meshy-assets.json
with the generator's license field ("Private"); check the generator's terms
before reuse outside this project.

REANIMATOR is a clean-room reimplementation. It does not contain, and this
license does not cover, any file from the 1995 DOS shareware release of
"Abuse" (Crack dot Com): executables, art, levels, sound effects, music, Lisp
scripts or documentation. Those files remain under their original owners'
terms, are used only locally for behavioral observation and numeric
comparison, and are excluded from this repository and from the public
build (see docs/reference/ASSET_REGISTER.md). "Abuse" and related names
belong to their respective owners; no affiliation or endorsement is implied.
